---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Reading's inbox mail grouped by sender, as before the edition

Usage: mxr reading senders [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --sender <SENDER>      Only this sender's bundle
      --limit <LIMIT>        Bundles to show [default: 50]
      --offset <OFFSET>      Bundles to skip, for paging [default: 0]
      --messages <MESSAGES>  Messages listed per bundle; counts always cover the whole bundle [default: 3]
      --account <ACCOUNT>    Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>      [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                 Print help
